                  <i>
                    Imminent Dawn
                  </i>
                </h2>
                <p
                  class="book-genre"
                >
                  Science Fiction
                </p>
                <p>
                  <i>
                    The International Book Awards finalist and first installment in the EMPATHY sci-fi saga.
                  </i>
                </p>
                <p>
                  When an art-school dropout enrolls in the first round of human trials for an internet-access brain implant, she never expects to find herself at the center of conspiracies stretching from the highest levels of the North American Union government to the lowest dredges of its shadowy hacking collectives.
                </p>
                <p>
                  <em>
                    As of December 2024, the EMPATHY sci-fi saga is out of print, its first two installments having been de-listed by their original publisher at my request. 
                  </em>
                </p>
