            <div
              class="section-wrapper book-metadata"
            >
              <h2
                class="book-title"
              >
                <i>
                  And Ampersand
                </i>
              </h2>
              <p
                class="book-genre"
              >
                Works of Short Fiction
              </p>
              <p>
                <i>
                  The perfect pocket companion for any reader who's tussled with the tie between beginning and end.
                </i>
              </p>
              <p>
                Your death comes on slowly, while elsewhere, a nameless man fakes his own. Encased in glass, a young man navigates a world meant for those beyond. A mudslide washes away a once romantic weekend, and a childhood swim drowns all illusion of innocence.
              </p>
              <p>
                These are but some of the tales in this collection of flash fiction, short stories, and freeform prose.
              </p>
              <div
                class="book-cta-button-container"
              >
                <button
                  data-testid="and-ampersand"
                >
                  Read a sample
                </button>
                <button
                  data-testid="https://www.amazon.com/dp/1736387111"
                >
                  Buy this book
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
